<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.custody.locks ~ lock drops the key the standing vessel holds

`lares vault lock` asks the standing vessel to drop its key, so every sovereign act waits on the next unlock; `--face N` drops that face's key alone, and the vessel stands at the floor only where N was the face it wore. Where the door's answer goes missing, a census confirms the lock; a lock nothing confirms refuses. No vessel on the store locks nothing and says so.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ lock · one-face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`lock` params=`~ drop the vessel key`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-face` params=`face/2 ~ drop face h2's key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the face whose key drops, by persona index`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ drops a held key; it opens nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · lock-unconfirmed · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.custody.locks face/2]] ~ --face names a handle index, a whole number from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`lock-unconfirmed` params=`cure/[[face.custody.locks]] ~ neither the door nor a census confirms the lock; read lares vault status`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the custody door's named refusals lead the line by class (OccupiedStoreRefusal, CustodyRefusal, TreeKeyRefusal, CensusRefusal, CustodyLockRefused, CustodyFoundingRefused, CredentialTtyRefusal, RotationSlotsRefused), exit 1`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ locked

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`locked` params=`exit/0 fields/[[locked was face confirmedBy standing]] ~ the key dropped; confirmedBy names the census where the door went quiet`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares vault lock

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares vault lock]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

